       - COMPACTNESS * PR.AXIS_RECTANGULARITY (combines shape compactness with rectangularity).
       - SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS * SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS (combines higher-order asymmetry).

